@* 分享链接：输入内容即时生成；纠错等级越高能扛的污损越多，码也越密；下载成 SVG（白底深色） *@
@inherits RuneComponent

<Flex Gap="SpaceScale.Lg" Align="ItemAlign.Center" Wrap="true">
    <QRCode Value="@value" ErrorCorrection="ecc" Size="CssLength.Em(9)" aria-label="邀请链接" />
    <Flex Direction="LayoutDirection.Column" Gap="SpaceScale.Sm" Sx="Panel">
        <Field Label="内容"><TextField @bind-Value="value" Immediate="true" /></Field>
        <Field Label="纠错等级">
            <ToggleGroup @bind-Value="Level" Required="true" Size="Size.Sm" aria-label="纠错等级">
                <ToggleItem Value="L">L 7%</ToggleItem>
                <ToggleItem Value="M">M 15%</ToggleItem>
                <ToggleItem Value="Q">Q 25%</ToggleItem>
                <ToggleItem Value="H">H 30%</ToggleItem>
            </ToggleGroup>
        </Field>
        <Flex Align="ItemAlign.Center" Gap="SpaceScale.Sm" Justify="ContentJustify.Between">
            <Small Tone="TextTone.Muted">版本 @Matrix.Version，@Matrix.Size × @Matrix.Size 个模块</Small>
            <LinkButton Href="@SvgUrl" Size="Size.Sm" Variant="ButtonVariant.Soft" Icon="Lucide.Download" download="invite.svg">下载 SVG</LinkButton>
        </Flex>
    </Flex>
</Flex>

@code {
    string value = "https://rune.example/invite/8f3a2c";
    QrErrorCorrection ecc = QrErrorCorrection.M;

    string? Level
    {
        get => ecc.ToString();
        set => ecc = Enum.Parse<QrErrorCorrection>(value!);
    }

    QrMatrix Matrix => QrEncoder.Encode(value, ecc);

    // 下载的文件：白底深色（同纸面在暗色主题下的颜色），四周留 2 个模块的静区
    string SvgUrl
    {
        get
        {
            var qr = Matrix;
            var extent = qr.Size + 4;
            var path = new System.Text.StringBuilder();
            for (var y = 0; y < qr.Size; y++)
                for (var x = 0; x < qr.Size; x++)
                    if (qr.IsDark(x, y)) path.Append(System.Globalization.CultureInfo.InvariantCulture, $"M{x + 2} {y + 2}h1v1h-1z");
            var svg = $"<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 {extent} {extent}\" shape-rendering=\"crispEdges\"><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"#fff\"/><path d=\"{path}\" fill=\"#1c2024\"/></svg>";
            return "data:image/svg+xml;charset=utf-8," + Uri.EscapeDataString(svg);
        }
    }

    static Style Panel => Css.Define(static () => new Style { Flex = "1 1 16em", MinWidth = 0 });
}
